{"steam_appid":1082190,"steam_name":"Elroy and the Aliens","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1082190/834310/01d7951ef1dd986774bc918d7c75dd2b0d356551/1751185976/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765380743","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101708/c6d7f966c82559ec6344be4d9c2e9c1398b79052/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765380743","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_2e90f171743bb5a0316df82cbfeea6de6d5e7b57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774179554","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_d6a67ee118943e15645b484d05281f3221de1562.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774179554","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_fff7ed947768358f989868ba07994b1a166b7f73.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774179554","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_b00dbdaabe4ef8fe9b8bb9940f5e8953d3b767b2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774179554","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_b117923f0d82ff1a7e0e000257ea20c29887d184.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774179554"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/84e0aa4ee678bdafb9959dad63ed335d.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Elroy </strong>and <strong>Peggie</strong> as you investigate the secret behind Elroy’s fathers <strong>mysterious disappearance</strong>. You will <strong>gather clues</strong>, solve intriguing <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover archaeological <strong>secrets</strong>, travel through <strong>portals,</strong> meet peculiar <strong>alien cultures </strong>and<strong> </strong>interact with <strong>sentient robots</strong> while you make your way to the truth in this <strong>modern point-and-click adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elroy</strong> is an ingenious rocket engineer haunted by his father’s, the famous archeologist’s vanishing 18 years ago. <strong>Peggie</strong> is a passionate investigative reporter with a knack for languages, history, and research. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their quest begins with the discovery of a secret crystal and an enigmatic message, launching them from their hometown of Slope City on a journey through the cosmos to find the father, all while unraveling a lurking <strong>threat to the very existence of the universe</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/a5efe168cdb4a08bc1052d7900475a49.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/0e47e614c483dfb5621d5f1f879c4999.poster.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/0e47e614c483dfb5621d5f1f879c4999.webm?t=1774179554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/cc9efbd7aefd7fce282f47fbe259ed09.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/60ae5405d0d8586390780bd8d74f07b6.poster.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/60ae5405d0d8586390780bd8d74f07b6.webm?t=1774179554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/f3f9bda8ffa220a7bf06d8d687b7fa86.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/8fe3385af86b4ead4739e7c7eb352030.poster.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/8fe3385af86b4ead4739e7c7eb352030.webm?t=1774179554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/fa9ed5ee8c31cd48cb53253bc75ccb6a.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/db13abe0fe5fd08e7d0c34093cc751ee.poster.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/db13abe0fe5fd08e7d0c34093cc751ee.webm?t=1774179554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/9f3fa9d0806e09640417b25aea0647fe.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/a6868881025bbc9cab8c8f6479485dfa.poster.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/a6868881025bbc9cab8c8f6479485dfa.webm?t=1774179554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/fd3f599bc3b40f4bbc322691c6e3a0e9.webp?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven point-and-click adventure game for both modern and classic audiences, set in an altered version of the 1990s with intelligent robots, paranormal activities and an ancient archaeological mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing and challenging puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story full of mystery, character development, ancient legends, alien language and occasional pop culture references.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning 2 planets, 60 locations and featuring more than 60 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution, hand-drawn 2D art and animations with an old-school vibe and modern polish. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-voiced characters and original music score for an immersive movie-like experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with accessibility in mind with helpful captions for color-based puzzles, subtitles, and different input options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay duration is approximately <strong>10 hours or more</strong>, depending on your playing style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/8738255e56ab96de7a88716b17541638.poster.avif?t=1774179554\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/extras/8738255e56ab96de7a88716b17541638.webm?t=1774179554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 12.0 compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 12.0 compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["Motiviti"],"publishers":["Motiviti"],"release_date":"2 Apr, 2025","metacritic_score":81}